  "aiContextParagraph": "The 49th ASEAN Summit is taking place in Manila, Philippines, drawing heads of state and international representatives to the Philippine International Convention Center. Leaders, including President Prabowo Subianto, Prime Minister Lawrence Wong, and Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim, have arrived in the capital to participate in high-level discussions. Key topics scheduled for the multi-day event include maritime security, trade policy, and a prevailing energy crisis affecting the region. Additionally, there is anticipation regarding the potential postponement of a decision concerning the representation of Myanmar officials at the summit. The gathering serves as a platform for Southeast Asian nations to coordinate on economic and geopolitical challenges while engaging with various global powers present for the associated meetings.",
